# app

> Test app.

## Global Options

- `-h, --help` — SHOW HELP FOR COMMAND.
- `--list-commands` — LIST ALL COMMANDS, INCLUDING SUBCOMMANDS.
- `--list-flags` — LIST ALL FLAGS.
- `--list-format enum[text\|json]` — OUTPUT FORMAT FOR --LIST-COMMANDS AND --LIST-FLAGS. (default: text)
- `--raw-envelope` — OUTPUT STRUCTURED NDJSON ENVELOPE INSTEAD OF PLAIN JSON DATA.

